- **Factual Citations & Standards Applied:**
  - **Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS):** Mandatory 6-digit alphanumeric HUID (Hallmark Unique Identification) code, triangular BIS logo, and purity hallmarks (750 for 18KT, 585 for 14KT).
